OL,3,GNEWSAGroup says canal is 'cleanest we
OL,4,Ahave ever seen it'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrustees have said the Erewash Canal is
OL,7,F"the cleanest we have ever seen it"
OL,8,Ffollowing a drop in levels of litter.
OL,10,FEarlier this summer, campaigners called
OL,11,Ffor more to be done at the canal, after
OL,12,Ffacing leaking locks, low water levels,
OL,13,Frepeated closures and a lack of
OL,14,Fmaintenance.
OL,16,FThe group said there has also been a
OL,17,Frise in wildlife numbers, with groups
OL,18,Fof frogs, toads and newts being seen on
OL,19,Fthe towpath in Ilkeston late at night.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
