OL,3,GNEWSAGroup says canal is 'cleanest we
OL,4,Ahave ever seen it'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe association has warned people not
OL,7,Fto touch the animals and to be careful
OL,8,Fwhen riding bikes along the towpath.
